# Cloudflare Pages adds these headers to every page of the website.
#
#   frame-ancestors 'none' / X-Frame-Options: no other website can show
#     PhilFreela inside a frame (clickjacking: tricking someone into clicking
#     a hidden button, like Delete or Approve).
#   nosniff: the browser must not guess a file's type, so an uploaded picture
#     can never be run as a script.
#   Referrer-Policy: other websites only learn that a visitor came from
#     PhilFreela, not which page they were on.
#   Permissions-Policy: only PhilFreela itself may ask for the camera and
#     microphone (face scan, calls, voice messages); location and payment are
#     not used at all.
#
# A full Content-Security-Policy (which scripts may run) is not set here: it
# has to be tried on every page with a real camera, call and sign-in first, or
# it would break the live site.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(self), geolocation=(), payment=()
